{"4331330":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Swarmfall","steam_appid":4331330,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swarmfall<\/i> is a game where you pilot a colossal Starship, leading the final remnants of humanity. It is a unique 2D &quot;bullet heaven&quot; roguelite with automated defensive fleets, fast-paced manoeuvring, and massive alien swarms to destroy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade the swarm.<\/strong> What is the swarm? An endless armada of geometric alien horrors, when destroyed, they drop scrap, and scrap is amazing. It allows you to purchase and upgrade escort ships to build your fleet. The Mothership must survive. Shooting the enemy is only half the battle, however, as you don't aim the weapons yourself. Your sole focus is piloting the Starship through the chaos to collect the scrap before you are overwhelmed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire and upgrade your fleet.<\/strong> Your escort ships represent the heart of the game. They are responsible for your defence and destroying the swarm. Your fleet adapts varying methodologies to reach its goal. Some are rapid-firing fighters that orbit closely, others are heavy bombers that unleash explosive blasts. You have ships that fire piercing lasers, and ships designed purely to absorb impacts. All for a single purpose, the survival of the Starship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strategic roguelite,<\/strong> <i>Swarmfall,<\/i> is about surviving escalating waves, but how you do that is up to you. At your disposal:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse roster of ships, with their varying strengths and firing patterns<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades that enhance and modify your Starship's core stats<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies that allow you to combine different ship types for devastating geometric crossfire<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and collection upgrades to enhance how efficiently you gather scrap<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss encounters that test the limits of your custom fleet<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy theorising about ship formations and executing survival builds in games, this game is for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead humanity through the Swarmfall?<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swarmfall<\/i> is a game where you pilot a colossal Starship, leading the final remnants of humanity. It is a unique 2D &quot;bullet heaven&quot; roguelite with automated defensive fleets, fast-paced manoeuvring, and massive alien swarms to destroy.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evade the swarm.<\/strong> What is the swarm? An endless armada of geometric alien horrors, when destroyed, they drop scrap, and scrap is amazing. It allows you to purchase and upgrade escort ships to build your fleet. The Mothership must survive. Shooting the enemy is only half the battle, however, as you don't aim the weapons yourself. Your sole focus is piloting the Starship through the chaos to collect the scrap before you are overwhelmed.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/b8770d53b185d6a5bef9fb2ffc0ec565.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acquire and upgrade your fleet.<\/strong> Your escort ships represent the heart of the game. They are responsible for your defence and destroying the swarm. Your fleet adapts varying methodologies to reach its goal. Some are rapid-firing fighters that orbit closely, others are heavy bombers that unleash explosive blasts. You have ships that fire piercing lasers, and ships designed purely to absorb impacts. All for a single purpose, the survival of the Starship.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=852 height=480 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/5c46c505979c28724660821e1b8008e2.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A strategic roguelite,<\/strong> <i>Swarmfall,<\/i> is about surviving escalating waves, but how you do that is up to you. At your disposal:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A diverse roster of ships, with their varying strengths and firing patterns<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades that enhance and modify your Starship's core stats<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synergies that allow you to combine different ship types for devastating geometric crossfire<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and collection upgrades to enhance how efficiently you gather scrap<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss encounters that test the limits of your custom fleet<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.poster.avif?t=1793640137\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.webm?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/extras\/83d5c2fb5c0fecf30a8bc177a52f85a8.mp4?t=1793640137\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy theorising about ship formations and executing survival builds in games, this game is for you.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you lead humanity through the Swarmfall?<\/p>","short_description":"Pilot humanity’s last starship and survive relentless alien swarms. Your automated fleet fights for you as you dodge, collect, and grow stronger every run.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/7a1e23e62a2f0b17272c58d098277af9985e75a3\/header.jpg?t=1793640137","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/7746b2ada5dc9dccce6b3a0849a04ee0b7132cc8\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793640137","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4331330\/7746b2ada5dc9dccce6b3a0849a04ee0b7132cc8\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793640137","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)\t<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2 Duo \/ A